  "worked_solution": "We have \n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned} & \\overset{\\to }{OA}=a=-i+2j, \\\\  & \\overset{\\to }{OB}=b=-i+3j.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nNow, from $△OAB$ we have\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\overset{\\to }{AB} & =\\overset{\\to }{AO}+\\overset{\\to }{OB} \\\\  & =-\\overset{\\to }{OA}+\\overset{\\to }{OB} \\\\  & =b-a \\\\  & =(-i+3j)-(-i+2j) \\\\  & =0i+j \\\\  & =j.\\end{aligned}\n$$",
